🧩 Sprint 1: Project Setup
HOPE INC. Customer Management System
📌 Overview

This sprint focuses on setting up the base project and preparing the system for development.

⚙️ 1. Project Setup

The project was initialized using modern web tools:

React (Vite)
Tailwind CSS
React Router DOM
Supabase

All required dependencies were installed using npm install.

🧭 2. Routing Setup

React Router DOM was used to handle navigation between pages.

Pages include:

Dashboard
Customers
Products
Sales
Login / Register
Reports
🔐 3. Supabase Setup

Supabase was added as the backend service for the system.

Connected using environment variables (.env file)
Prepared for authentication (login and registration)
Prepared for database integration
🎨 4. UI Setup

A basic layout structure was created to ensure consistency across pages:

Sidebar navigation
Top Navbar
Main content area
🧪 5. Output of Sprint 1

At the end of Sprint 1:

The project runs using Vite
Navigation between pages is working
Basic UI layout is ready
Supabase is set up and ready for use
🚧 6. Current Status
Backend features are not yet fully implemented
Some pages are still basic or placeholder
More features will be developed in Sprint 2 and Sprint 3
📌 Conclusion

Sprint 1 successfully established the foundation of the HOPE INC. Customer Management System. The project is now ready for further development and feature integration in the next sprints.
